      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is to replace 3–5 at% phosphorus with boron while retaining Cr, Mn, Fe, Co, and Ni at 16 at% each.",
